John:

It sounds like a dead battery.  If you don't have a reasonably good
electronics store handy (like Radio Shack) go to the local Apple dealer, the
earlier Apples used the exact same battery.   Or you can link 3 AA batteries
together, just make sure they are outputting 4.5 V.

The firmware resetting it self is a pretty good clue that it forgot who or
what it was.  It is the hardware default for these machines.

Let me know if you have any more questions.  I've three of the little
beasties, one running WinNT, one running Linux 6.0 and one that I'm trying to
get OpenVms running on.

