apparatus during the entire demo. The operating console is
right between the 4000 volt DC power supply and the 150,000
volt AC power supply.

This is the smaller MK II device, which is the scaled down
'toy' version.

The demo, like the 'EV6' Electric Vlasic we did of a couple
years ago, will be a mixture of real technology and
presentation, in the spirit of the excellent "vms magic"
presentations of National DECUS events. We do promise there
will be no burnt organic materials or sour pickle odors this
time.

To determine the saftey, we have measured the field density
outside the fixture area. It is so low that you would absorb
more energy from standing next to an 18-wheeler when that
good ol' boy keys up his 400 watt CB set.

Because our apparatus uses electromagnetic energy for the
demo, we ask that anyone with a pacemaker temporarily take a
seat in the back of the room. There is really no danger, but
why take chances? I wear glasses with metal frames, which is
effectively an antenna with electrodes attached, coupled
directly to my brain, so believe me I have seen to the
saftey issues quite thoroughly. I will of course be in very
close proximity to the equipment during the entire demo.

In closing, we are operating a real special piece of
equipment and one should not place one's palm pilot or
cellphone on the Altar of Doom. If anyone has a DELL pc,
however, we are accepting offerings... >;)

