Oh!  May I ask in which FM you found that perl of wisdom?  Do you still
apply it to boxes with 4 GB of a physical memory on board?  This manual
would be somewhat obsolete and not for Linux, I suppose?  As a matter of
fact Linux can run happily with a zero swap space and although this is
